<title>USA: Hot Topic Q2 same store sales rise.</title>
<headline>Hot Topic Q2 same store sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>POMONA, Calif. 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hot Topic Inc said Wednesday its same store sales were up 0.7 percent in the second quarter and total sales rose 54 percent to $13.7 million.</p>
<p>For the 26-week period ended August 2, same-store sales rose three percent and total sales were up 61 percent to $24.9 million.</p>
